    "description": "Icarus - shot down. Fly a Primeva F-204 Icarus II over Ignus at 9,000 m MSL, heading 090, 280 m/s, 60% fuel. Interceptor load: two MMR-S3, two AAM-36 Scimitars and two conformal AAM-29 Scythes. Two Boscali KR-67 Ifrits approach from 22 km; four more spawn at 120 seconds farther east. Each has the internal 27 mm gun with 540 rounds, six Scimitars, four Scythes, four MMR-S3 and two IRM-S2. No other combat units or automatic reinforcements. Let the enemy hit you to inspect destruction.",
